{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01861","headline":"杂曲歌辞 卢姬篇 · 崔颢","name":"杂曲歌辞 卢姬篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卢姬小小魏王家，绿鬓红唇桃李花。\n魏王绮楼十二重，水精帘箔绣芙蓉。\n白玉阑干金作柱，楼上朝朝学歌舞。\n前堂後堂罗袖人，南窗北窗花发春。\n翠幌珠帘鬬弦管，一奏一弹云欲断。\n君王日晚下朝归，鸣环佩玉生光辉。\n人生今日得骄贵，谁道卢姬身细微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}